Chess Puzzle Coach

An offline-first chess puzzle web app that combines Lichess puzzles with LLM-generated hints and explanations to provide an interactive chess coaching experience.

The app is designed around a simple principle:

Chess correctness is deterministic; AI provides the coaching.

Puzzle solutions are validated against the original Lichess solution data, while an LLM generates natural-language hints and explanations ahead of time. This allows the app to run without an LLM or chess engine during gameplay.

Features
♟️ Interactive chess puzzles with a responsive web chessboard
🧩 2,000+ curated Lichess puzzles across a range of tactical themes
💡 Progressive hints after incorrect attempts
🤖 AI-generated explanations describing the tactical idea behind each solution
📚 Theme-based practice such as forks, pins, skewers, sacrifices, and discovered attacks
📈 Difficulty-aware puzzle selection
🔌 Offline-first gameplay with no network requests required to solve puzzles
⚡ Instant deterministic move validation
📊 Progress tracking including accuracy, streaks, and puzzle performance
