Progressive Web App (PWA) support
Larger puzzle corpus
Data Source

Puzzle data is sourced from the Lichess open puzzle database.

Lichess puzzle data is released under the Creative Commons CC0 public-domain dedication.

See the Lichess database documentation for dataset availability and licensing information.

